## Server-side dependencies

None are bundled. The application deliberately requires no Composer packages at
runtime, so there is no vendor tree to audit.

It does rely on PHP extensions: `pdo_mysql` or `pdo_sqlite`, `mbstring`, `json`,
and — depending on which features are used — `gd` for image conversion,
`curl` for the GitHub and Steam integrations, and `openssl` for encrypting
private notes. These are distributed with PHP itself under the PHP Licence.

